    "bgm": "029",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まいったな、もう少しで外出なのに……\r\nどうにか止んでくれるといいんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それは……晴れてくれなきゃですね……\r\n……やっぱり雨は憂鬱です……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………う～ん\r\n雨は憂鬱だから……その反対……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……千雪？\r\nそれ……何を書いてるんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "雑誌用のアンケートです\r\n自分の好きなものについて考えてるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\n確か、『わたしの好きなもの50』……だっけ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうなんです\r\n50個ともなると、なかなか思い付かなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……確かにその数はな……\r\n──あ、それなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "会話しながらだったら、思い付くものもあるかもしれない\r\n適当に、何か話でもしてみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "えっ、協力してくださるんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "と言っても、次の外出までだから……\r\nそんなに時間もないんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いえいえ、とっても助かります……！\r\n……そうだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010070"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0177",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\nよかったらこのドーナツ、おひとつどうぞ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "作業のお供にと思って買ってたんですけど……\r\nおすそ分けです。お礼、ということで",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そんなに気を遣うことじゃないんだけどな\r\n……でも、せっかくだから、ありがたく頂くよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はいっ。……あの、参考までに……プロデューサーさんの\r\n好きなものも、教えてくださったり……とか",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、俺の好きなものか……そうだなぁ\r\n……えっと……あ、『仕事の合間のドーナツ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、もう……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "──あぁ、それじゃあ……お菓子繋がりで、\r\n私が好きなのは『ショートケーキのいちご』です♪",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010120"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0170",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、早速出てきたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なんだか、これならどんどん埋めていけそうです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、千雪の役に立てたみたいでよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……それに、プロデューサーさんの\r\nお話も、もっと聞かせてもらいたいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺なんかのでよければ……\r\nうーん、お菓子繋がり……食べ物……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、好きなものをいっぱい買って\r\n『大人食い』とか……って、子どもっぽいか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わぁ……それ、私もたまにご褒美でやっちゃいます……！\r\nでは、私は──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004010160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "『まんなかバースデー』\r\nふふっ、次はプロデューサーさんの番です",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600401/2016004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　えっと……『夏の早朝』",
